{"originalLanguage":"ja","title":"고음충 음역 테스트","artist":"木村わいP","date":"2026-08-21","sourceId":"14805053:013","sourceHash":"f131bbe60d1f41a6bf7b33357b57dbbe1a117e6b8796fe4cb3bc93f2c0069035","duration":96.08,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":7.68,"end":10.1,"text":"こんにちわ 初音ミクだよ","translation":"안녕 하츠네 미쿠야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":11.14,"end":12.42,"text":"音域テストを 始めるよ","translation":"음역 테스트를 시작할게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":12.42,"end":15.34,"text":"高音厨のお前らならば","translation":"고음충인 너희라면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":15.34,"end":17.42,"text":"余裕で歌えるね","translation":"여유롭게 부를 수 있지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":17.58,"end":22.64,"text":"Hi-A, hi-B, hi-C-D-C","translation":"Hi-A hi-B hi-C-D-C","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":23.02,"end":24.58,"text":"こんなの重低音だね","translation":"이런 건 아주 낮은 음이지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":26.38,"end":28.46,"text":"すこしだけ音を上げるよ","translation":"조금만 음을 올릴게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":28.46,"end":30.92,"text":"普通の人なら出ないけど","translation":"보통 사람은 못 내지만","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":30.92,"end":34.06,"text":"高音厨のお前らならば","translation":"고음충인 너희라면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":34.06,"end":36.04,"text":"風邪でも歌えるね","translation":"감기에 걸려도 부를 수 있지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":36.62,"end":41.66,"text":"Hi-D, hi-E, hi-F-G-F","translation":"Hi-D hi-E hi-F-G-F","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":41.66,"end":44.54,"text":"まだまだ中音域だね","translation":"아직 한참 중음역이지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":44.72,"end":47.6,"text":"もうちょっと音を上げるよ","translation":"조금 더 음을 올릴게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":47.76,"end":49.22,"text":"ファルセットだけじゃきついかな？","translation":"가성만으로는 힘드려나","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":50.08,"end":52.66,"text":"高音厨のお前らならば","translation":"고음충인 너희라면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":52.66,"end":54.72,"text":"朝飯前だよね","translation":"식은 죽 먹기지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":54.98,"end":60.2,"text":"Hi-G, hi-hi-A, hi-hi-A#-C-D","translation":"Hi-G hi-hi-A hi-hi-A#-C-D","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":61.4,"end":63.3,"text":"ギブアップしてもいいのよ？","translation":"포기해도 괜찮아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":63.54,"end":65.76,"text":"最後は一気にあげちゃうよ","translation":"마지막은 단숨에 올릴게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":65.76,"end":68.78,"text":"もはや歌詞も聞き取れないね","translation":"이젠 가사도 들리지 않겠네","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":70.02,"end":71.16,"text":"高音厨の本気の力","translation":"고음충의 진짜 힘을","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":71.16,"end":72.64,"text":"見せておくれよ","translation":"보여 줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":73.2,"end":78.94,"text":"Hi-hi-C, hi-hi-D, hi-hi-D#-F-G","translation":"Hi-hi-C hi-hi-D hi-hi-D#-F-G","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":78.94,"end":79.69,"text":"終わりだよ","translation":"끝이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":79.69,"end":80.31,"text":"いや嘘だよ","translation":"아니 거짓말이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":80.31,"end":86.68,"text":"Hi-hi-hi-A, hi-hi-hi-B, hi-hi-hi-C-D-E","translation":"Hi-hi-hi-A hi-hi-hi-B hi-hi-hi-C-D-E","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":86.68,"end":88.76,"text":"ここまで出たなら","translation":"여기까지 나왔다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":88.76,"end":89.86,"text":"合格","translation":"합격","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}